                <td>Sends a suspicious login alert to the SOAR platform.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Threat Intelligence</strong></td>
                <td>Context on whether an indicator is known to be malicious.</td>
                <td>Checks an extracted IP address against a reputation database.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Ticketing System</strong></td>
                <td>A tracked case record for the incident.</td>
                <td>Creates a case and updates it as the playbook progresses.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

